OL,3,GNEWSAPart of former private school
OL,4,Acould be demolished after fire and
OL,5,Abreak-ins
OL,6,
OL,7,FBuildings at a former private school in
OL,8,FSouth Lanarkshire could be demolished
OL,9,Ffollowing reports of break-ins,
OL,10,Fanti-social behaviour and a fire at the
OL,11,Fvacant site.
OL,13,FAn application has been submitted to
OL,14,Fthe local authority seeking permission
OL,15,Fto remove buildings surrounding the
OL,16,Fhistoric Fernhill School property on
OL,17,FFernbrae Avenue in Rutherglen.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
