OL,3,GNEWSAPart of former private school
OL,4,Acould be demolished after fire and
OL,5,Abreak-ins
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe school closed earlier this year,
OL,8,Fwith Fernhill's directors saying it
OL,9,Ffaced "rising costs and VAT on school
OL,10,Ffees", as well as many other
OL,11,Fchallenges.
OL,13,FIn September a fire broke out at the
OL,14,Fabandoned premises, with one eyewitness
OL,15,Fsaying fireworks appeared to have been
OL,16,Fgoing off inside the building before
OL,17,Fthe blaze started.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
